    "title": "Self-evolution is a generate \u2192 verify \u2192 learn loop",
    "description": "Self-evolving language models generate candidates, use a verifier or critic to keep good examples, fine-tune, and repeat. STaR filters rationales by answer correctness and can rationalize failures; ReST alternates Grow and Improve; Constitutional AI uses critique/revision and AI feedback."
